168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (Why it matters: This is the $80,000-$200,000 mistake families make. Many people sell their house immediately to pay for aged care, not knowing the house might be EXEMPT from the asset test for up to 2 years. Selling too early means you pay capital gains tax, lose the exemption period, and can't benefit if property values rise. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
